{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1166621-how-to-make-a-demolition-derby-a-interesting-setting","id":1166621,"title":"how to make a demolition derby a interesting setting","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-12-10T23:01:53-08:00","id":1166621,"title":"how to make a demolition derby a interesting setting","content":"I am thinking about getting C20 for Christmas and i have a question. One possible story i have planned has the Climax, which is them confronting a lieutenant of a street gang, at a demolition derby. My question is how could a demolition derby be a interesting setting in a Changeling game?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-11T08:12:53-08:00","id":1166710,"title":"","content":"Between Arts, Unleashing, and a nocker in the group, I don't see how it could *not* be interesting! Just be prepared for massive in game property damage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-11T09:37:37-08:00","id":1166731,"title":"","content":"Thunderdome?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23589-jimalcoatl","name":"Jimalcoatl","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-11T09:57:25-08:00","id":1166738,"title":"","content":"Good point Pooka. I wonder what a car made by a Nocker for a demolition derby would look like? I am also wondering how much damage a Unleashing would cause.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-11T10:06:37-08:00","id":1166742,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Killerclown</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1166621-how-to-make-a-demolition-derby-a-interesting-setting?p=1166738#post1166738\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Good point Pooka. I wonder what a car made by a Nocker for a demolition derby would look like? I am also wondering how much damage a Unleashing would cause.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm more interested in what a Derby car made by a Goblin would be like personally.<br /> <br /> I really do think a post apocalyptic mien for the local Dreaming and Chimerical reality would fit this though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23589-jimalcoatl","name":"Jimalcoatl","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-11T10:17:33-08:00","id":1166746,"title":"","content":"I can see a demolition derby as prime picking and staging grounds for nockers, either physical or chimerical machines going all out and the salvage ripe for the pickings possibly some glamour to harvest from the roaring crowds of people simply wanting to see destruction! Geeze if a Goblin gets involved these cars are gonna be weaponized ala mad max! The place might also host a scrap beast or two.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11808-freederp92","name":"Freederp92","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-11T12:24:33-08:00","id":1166769,"title":"","content":"I wonder how the dreaming of a medium sized, New England town can be post-apocalyptic? Also, I am picturing a Goblin hanging out with a bunch of leather-jacket wearing motorheads, a couple of them are Enchanted of course. I also like the idea of Changelings using the derby as a way to get glamour by showing off their fancy, destruction dealing car designs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-11T14:57:16-08:00","id":1166829,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Killerclown</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1166621-how-to-make-a-demolition-derby-a-interesting-setting?p=1166769#post1166769\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder how the dreaming of a medium sized, New England town can be post-apocalyptic? Also, I am picturing a Goblin hanging out with a bunch of leather-jacket wearing motorheads, a couple of them are Enchanted of course. I also like the idea of Changelings using the derby as a way to get glamour by showing off their fancy, destruction dealing car designs.</div> </div> </div> </div>The same town, but in ruins shored up by pallets and corrugated steel plates. I would limit it to the Derby grounds though personally.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23589-jimalcoatl","name":"Jimalcoatl","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-12T00:34:08-08:00","id":1166928,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Killerclown</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1166621-how-to-make-a-demolition-derby-a-interesting-setting?p=1166769#post1166769\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder how the dreaming of a medium sized, New England town can be post-apocalyptic? Also, I am picturing a Goblin hanging out with a bunch of leather-jacket wearing motorheads, a couple of them are Enchanted of course. I also like the idea of Changelings using the derby as a way to get glamour by showing off their fancy, destruction dealing car designs.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> A group of changelings could also make the derby ring and its surrounding area a freehold, the chimeras spawned from the mechanical mayhem cannibalized to enhance vehicles and devices by the Goblin and its fellow mechanically inclined allies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11808-freederp92","name":"Freederp92","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-12T15:32:09-08:00","id":1167158,"title":"","content":"A demolition derby created for the Dreaming, you say?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yiFOhqPEI6g\" data-code=\"yiFOhqPEI6g\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/yiFOhqPEI6g/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-13T15:51:41-08:00","id":1167435,"title":"","content":"It doesn't even have to be in the Dreaming to be post-apocalyptic. Picture a long stretch of decaying rust belt towns with precious little Glamour to go around. There is a Changeling gang leader/warlord/demagogue who controls a large source of Dross and siphons it out to maintain control. Local Kithain gearheads fix up old beaters and drag race them along deserted roads and through the ruins of industry. To the rare witness they're just growling junkers, but to the enchanted they're souped up fever dreams of automotive madness.<br /> <br /> Changeling: Fury Road","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-13T18:29:47-08:00","id":1167474,"title":"","content":"So it\u2019s a little off topic, but the discussion about Changeling Mad Max reminds me - I\u2019ve viewed Changeling: The Dreaming as a post-post-apocalyptic setting for awhile now.<br /> <br /> It\u2019s a post-apocalyptic setting that\u2019s only been starting to recover for the past fifty years. There\u2019s still lots of broken infrastructure of the Dreaming from before the Shattering - lots of ruins and \u201cforbidden zones\u201d waiting to be reclaimed, lost knowledge to be relearned, lost treasures the very existence of which are long forgotten, broken half-remember oaths that once held the world together that need to be reforged.<br /> <br /> Things are much better than they were fifty years ago for changelings, but if the Kithain venture too far from the relatively Glamour rich urban environments filled with Dreamers, they\u2019re going to be struggling for survival.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-13T22:13:38-08:00","id":1167519,"title":"","content":"If one wants to go a little more Death Race 2000 have the Shadow Court put on a rumbling, adrenaline-fueled chase across the many abandoned roads of America. Desolate stretches of overgrown asphalt connected by Trods through dangerous and wooly tracts of Dreaming.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-15T16:08:14-08:00","id":1168043,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jimalcoatl</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1166621-how-to-make-a-demolition-derby-a-interesting-setting?p=1166731#post1166731\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thunderdome?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eiX94V7ZtCg\" target=\"_blank\">Thunder Hollow</a>?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12192-rabdos","name":"Rabdos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12192_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-15T19:07:33-08:00","id":1168095,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rabdos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1166621-how-to-make-a-demolition-derby-a-interesting-setting?p=1168043#post1168043\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eiX94V7ZtCg\" target=\"_blank\">Thunder Hollow</a>?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Goblin + Ogre = Masterblaster?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23589-jimalcoatl","name":"Jimalcoatl","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}